    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><em>You become a living archive of possible selves.</em></p><p>Once per <strong>Soma Break</strong>, as a <strong>bonus action</strong>, you manifest the Thousandfold Echo for <strong>1 minute</strong>:</p><ul><li>You may switch between your prepared personas as a <strong>free interaction</strong> (no action) on your turn.</li><li>Whenever you switch personas, you gain a <strong>+1 bonus</strong> to your next Stealth (Intrigue), Diplomacy (Presence), or Performance (Presence) check before the end of your turn (stacking up to a maximum of +3).</li><li>During this time, creatures attempting to recall your true identity or appearance roll 3d10 and keep the lowest 2 on such checks or saves.</li></ul><p><strong>Strategic Echo.</strong> If a major intrigue, or Parley scenario concluded under Thousandfold Echo ends in a <strong>Best Friends / Integration</strong> or <strong>Justice / Reformation</strong> style outcome, your Domain gains <strong>+10 Soft Power marks</strong> and <strong>+10 Intrigue marks</strong> as the legend of your many faces spreads.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
